## Limitations (Transparent)

1. **No live multi-device sync** — Drive is backup/restore, not continuous sync.
2. **Local JSON export ≠ full image backup.**
3. **VIP one-time is on-device only** — without a server, the same code can be used on another device.
4. **Store IAP not live yet** — Get Premium is a stub; VIP covers tester Premium.
5. **Certificates are an on-device register** (included in Drive backups), not an online registry — no QR/lookup yet.
6. **iOS media depth deferred**; web is not a production vault host.
7. **Drive / portfolio PDF / certificates** need a native Android or iOS build (not Expo Go for Drive Sign-In).

